<title>USA: Accent Software names CFO.</title>
<headline>Accent Software names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accent Software International Ltd on Monday said it named Robert Behr as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Behr was previously corporate controller at Ameridata, Accent said.</p>
<p>The name of Behr's predecessor was not immediately available.</p>
